{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_tachak_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_tachak_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "一如既往",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_tachak_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "77cfec51c5e45e7309c1207bb9d1c1e3d9152c24c2f28c315b48c41fba71ec02",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“你收到这封信的时候，那边多半已经入冬了。”\n“乌萨斯的冬天想必更加恶劣。”\n“如果可以的话，我希望你能早一点回来。”\n“我希望你没有被卷入那边的乱局里。”\n“最后还有一句友善的提醒。”\n“我知道你做事的风格，但是别掺和太深。”\n“祝你好运，Lord。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "“别掺和太深”么。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "现在说这些，也没啥意义了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "唉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "亚历山大看着眼前的设备与工具，发出了一声长叹，默默地收起了那封信件。\n伴随着他的叹息，凝聚的水汽在空气中形成了一片薄雾。\n在他眼前摆放着一台造型古怪的设备，厚实的金属轨道上充满粗糙打磨的痕迹，未经抛光的板材略显浮锈。\n在古怪设备旁边，亚历山大小心谨慎地操作着用木头搭建的吊装工具，进行最后的作业。\n吊装台的麻绳上挂着一台源石发动机，也是眼前这台古怪设备的最后一块拼图。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "搞定！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "联轴器没什么问题，我的扳手呢......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "水平尺，我把水平尺丢哪了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "魁梧的士兵从一旁的木箱里拿出了一把用桦木与小玻璃瓶自制的水平尺，尽可能地调整发动机与设备之间连接件的位置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "我看看......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "供能装置正常，电压......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "这上哪儿能弄到电压表啊，凑合着用吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "五十年代的时候他们都是怎么造这些东西的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "这个扭矩......希望材料够结实。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在数分钟的摆弄后，仓库里传出了阵阵机械的轰鸣声。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "哈！哈！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "成功了！哈哈哈哈！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "动起来了！哈哈哈哈！动起来了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "亚历山大先生？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "阿尔苏先生，你来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "这么早你就在工作了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "哎哟？这机器终于动起来了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "值得庆祝啊！折腾了两个月，也算是没有白费功夫。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "可惜酒已经喝完了，不知道商队什么时候才来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "这可不好说，一到冬天那些商队的人就不愿意走太远了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "有了这台机器，就算是商队的人不来，我也可以自己加工一些简单的零件。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "比如，上次坏掉的那台手摇泵就可以修好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "回头可以教教村里其他人怎么操作这台机器，会方便很多的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "这种机器叫什么来着......机床？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "以前听我儿子聊过这些......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "说起来，我来这边这么久，还没见过你儿子呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "他工作的地方虽然不远，但出了村子要翻一座山才能到，一到冬天山路就不好走，所以我很少让他回来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "山的东边？那边确实有个矿区，好像是附近移动城市的附属地块。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "亚历山大先生似乎对这附近的情况很熟悉啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "之前去和流民聚落交换物资的时候，我多打听了一点周围的情况。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "过几天可能还得去一次，希望在此之前不要下大雪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "这段时间你还是别去找那些荒地人了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "税官的队伍就要来了，要是让他们知道我们和荒地人做生意，要出大事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "出大事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "其他地方我不知道，但是费季索夫大人不允许我们和荒地人过多接触。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "不准接触那些流民？为什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "以前会有军队的人来宣传，说这些荒地流民很多都是卡西米尔来的间谍。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "还有什么锈锤之类的暴徒混在里面。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "原来是这样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "但是我看那个荒地人聚落的居民大多都是乌萨斯人啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "以前不是这样的......唉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "前些年根本没有这么多荒地流民，那时候的荒地人大多都是从乌萨斯以外的地方跑来的，很快就会被费季索夫大人的卫兵赶走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "但是现在......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "那个流民聚落里的乌萨斯人，都是从其他村子逃跑的人吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "比如咱们村，前些年还有两百多人呢，这两年都跑光了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "佃农跑了，人越来越少，也没人种地，做生意的人也不来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "外加今年要交的税更高了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "哦哦，人口流失，这个我熟悉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "那你们的领主呢？那位“费季索夫大人”就完全不管？自己领地里的佃农全跑了，他吃什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "这......这我也不清楚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "不过费季索夫大人应该还在忙着处理北边的流寇吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "怎么还有流寇？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "哦！是之前村里人说的那些土匪？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "流寇这个称呼还真少见，这些“流寇”又是什么人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "这都一个月了，你们的领主还没解决这个问题？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "普通的土匪也不是乌萨斯军队的对手吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "这我也不清楚，但是他们说那些流寇训练有素，专门打劫贵族的财产，还袭击了军队。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "我也不知道一群土匪是哪儿来的胆子......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "训练有素、反抗贵族的“土匪”，这故事我还真听过，很耳熟。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "不如说太熟悉了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "那句老话怎么说的来着？历史总是惊人地相似。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "呃，亚历山大先生以前也经历过这种事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "没什么，我瞎说的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "老爷子！老爷子！你怎么在这儿！他们都在找你呢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "喘口气，喘口气，有什么事慢慢说。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "哎呀，你快点回家，你儿子......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "我儿子回来了？今天？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "不对啊......他怎么回来了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "你快点过去吧！他出事了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "什么？？？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妇人",
      "text": "阿尔苏你可来了，你儿子......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "我儿子怎么了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妇人",
      "text": "早上我去整理木柴，结果在村南面看到有人倒在村口，吓我一跳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妇人",
      "text": "走近一看才发现是安瓦尔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妇人",
      "text": "幸亏发现得及时啊，要是再拖一阵，可就不好说了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "实在是太感谢了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妇人",
      "text": "伤口我简单帮他包扎了一下，他身上没冻伤，我估计才倒在那没多久。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妇人",
      "text": "不过......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "怎么了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妇人",
      "text": "唉，我只能说你可要准备好啊......你儿子，他好像感染了矿石病。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "什么！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妇人",
      "text": "他胳膊上......你自己看吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "这......这......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "老人颤抖着后退了一步，一脸惊恐地看着自己的儿子。\n恐惧、担忧、疑虑的神情在短短几秒内闪过了他的脸庞。\n但是最终只剩下了悲痛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "其他人......其他人知道吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妇人",
      "text": "我还没说。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "求求您，您可......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妇人",
      "text": "我知道，我知道，你就这一个儿子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妇人",
      "text": "这几天我会让大家别靠近你家，我就说你儿子身上有湿疫。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妇人",
      "text": "但是这可是矿石病，你明白吧？你可得想清楚咯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "谢谢您......谢谢......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "看起来情况不是很好？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "亚历山大先生！你怎么来了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "你......你还是先出去......我儿子......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "矿石病，是吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "！！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "......亚......亚历山大先生，这......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "好了，别紧张，我是来帮忙的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "这可......亚历山大先生，这可是矿石病啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "我接触过不少矿石病人，我不在乎这个，你放心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "......唉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "把他上衣脱掉，把这个药涂在有结晶的地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "这是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "我说了，我之前接触过不少矿石病人，按我说的做。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "这是注射用的药，你来帮我一把，我去弄一点热水。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "还有这个，如果他身上的结晶有血渗出来，把血滴在这个试纸上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "我明白了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "几分钟后"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年轻人",
      "text": "我......我这是在哪......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "安瓦尔！你醒了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦尔",
      "text": "老......老爹？我怎么......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "好了，别说了，你回来了就好......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦尔",
      "text": "这里是......在家里？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦尔",
      "text": "不对！我不能待在这，我有矿石病！我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "我知道......我知道，别说了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "你萨尼婶好心没有告诉其他人，也幸亏是她先发现了你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "等你伤好一点，我带你去林子里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "那边有个猎人的小屋，废弃很久了，你就先住在那边吧，我们回头再想办法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦尔",
      "text": "唉......老爹......我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "好了，别说了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "你先休息吧，我去打点水，不要乱跑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "醒了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦尔",
      "text": "你是......雇佣兵！为什么村子里会有雇佣兵？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "别担心，我是你父亲的朋友。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "你的矿石病不严重，只是轻症。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦尔",
      "text": "以前没见过你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "我也是今年才到这里来，你叫我亚历山大就行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "所以到底发生什么事了，你不是在工厂那边工作吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦尔",
      "text": "两周前......工厂的锅炉炸了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦尔",
      "text": "我和其他几个工人都感染了矿石病。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦尔",
      "text": "然后工厂的负责人就把我们都赶出去了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "就这样？没有人追你？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦尔",
      "text": "一开始我们发现有人跟着我们......但是后来也没管那么多了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "......这么轻易就放你们跑了，有点不对劲。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "算了，你还是先歇着吧，别想那么多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "你还好么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "亚历山大先生......这......这可怎么办啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "答案只有一个，面对现实。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "可......这矿石病......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "你儿子的矿石病是轻症，这种程度的轻症有很多办法延缓病情的发展。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "你怎么这么了解这个病......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "这个就说来话长了，不过现在还有另一个问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "在乌萨斯这个地方，就算是轻症，你儿子以后的生活也会非常艰难。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "唉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "那就让他学会像荒地人那样活着。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "就像是那些捕捉野生裂兽的猎人一样，他得学会怎么生活在荒野里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "我可以教他一些东西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一周后"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "稳住......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦尔",
      "text": "（聚精会神地瞄准）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "稳住......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦尔",
      "text": "（扣下扳机）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦尔",
      "text": "啊！没打中......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "扣扳机不要那么用力，会影响箭矢的轨迹。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦尔",
      "text": "唉......可能我不是这块料。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "先别急着说丧气话，这才一个星期，你这准头已经不错了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "打活物和打固定靶可不太一样，再多练练吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "去休息一会儿，一个小时以后进行体能训练。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "想要在野外生存，你要学的东西还很多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦尔",
      "text": "亚历山大先生......还真是厉害啊，你以前是一位军人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦尔",
      "text": "你看起来可比乌萨斯那些普通士兵靠谱多了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "我现在依然是军人，只是情况稍微有点复杂......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "说起来，你老爹今天怎么没来，这都中午了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦尔",
      "text": "可能是有点什么事耽搁了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨尼婶",
      "text": "安瓦尔！安瓦尔！快点收拾东西！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦尔",
      "text": "怎么了？您慢点，出什么事了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨尼婶",
      "text": "别问了，感染者纠察队来村子里了，他们到你家去了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦尔",
      "text": "什么？？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨尼婶",
      "text": "你快点收拾东西先走，这边距离村子太近了，他们肯定会找过来的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦尔",
      "text": "那我爸怎么办！我不能丢下他......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨尼婶",
      "text": "哎呀，你别管那么多了，要是你被发现了，全村人都要遭殃！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨尼婶",
      "text": "快跑吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "......来了多少人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨尼婶",
      "text": "来了两个纠察官和四五个打手，一个个都凶神恶煞的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "都是乌萨斯人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨尼婶",
      "text": "那两个纠察官应该是，其他几个看着不像。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨尼婶",
      "text": "哎呀，你现在还问这个干什么，亚历山大先生你也避避风头吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "安瓦尔，带上你的武器和之前我给你的那套伪装服，跟我走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦尔",
      "text": "......我明白了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者纠察队",
      "text": "张嘴啊！人呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "他......他没......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者纠察队",
      "text": "你*粗口*少给我来这一套，我们看着他跑到村子里的，把人交出来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "大老爷，我根本没见到他！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "我没骗你，我说的都是真的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者纠察队",
      "text": "你这个两条腿的畜生，真当我傻？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者纠察队",
      "text": "既然你儿子没留在这里，那你屋子里这工服和工鞋是谁的？啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者纠察队",
      "text": "好啊，你不说没问题，我们可以找，我们有的是时间。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "求求你们，你们抓我走！我去给费季索夫老爷干苦工！我什么都干！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "求求你们，放过我儿子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者纠察队",
      "text": "你觉得干苦工这事情就完了？你想得倒挺好啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者纠察队",
      "text": "你们几个，把这附近所有人都带走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佣兵",
      "text": "明白。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "你们......你们要干什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者纠察队",
      "text": "干什么？这个村子因为帮助感染者逃跑，已经犯了滔天大罪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者纠察队",
      "text": "作为惩罚，费季索夫大人要没收你们所有人的土地。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "什么！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "我们不知道啊大人！这不关我们的事情啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村妇",
      "text": "大人，没有这个道理啊，我们根本就不知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佣兵",
      "text": "少废话，都给我抓起来！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦尔",
      "text": "这群*粗口*，我就知道......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "这事情果然有蹊跷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "故意放跑感染者，让他们回家，好找个理由收了自耕农的地，顺带把他们抓去干苦力。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "感染者可真是个万能的借口啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "这故事我也熟悉，一点儿都不新鲜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦尔",
      "text": "这群*粗口*，我要和他们拼了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "冷静点，听我指挥。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦尔",
      "text": "你讲，我全听你的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "你看到村东边那个高地了么？你在那边埋伏。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "等收到我的信号，你就向那五个打手射击。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "别管打中没打中，剩下的交给我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦尔",
      "text": "明白！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "村子里有垃圾，该打扫卫生了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佣兵",
      "text": "这村子里能有几个人啊？我还得挨个去找？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者纠察队",
      "text": "哪儿那么多废话，快去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佣兵",
      "text": "行吧......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佣兵",
      "text": "有人向我们射击！这什么准头啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者纠察队",
      "text": "*粗口*，胆子挺大啊！人在哪？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佣兵",
      "text": "东边，在那个山坡上！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者纠察队",
      "text": "你们俩去把人给我揪出来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者纠察队",
      "text": "有敌人，找掩护！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佣兵",
      "text": "敌人？这破地方？怎么搞的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者纠察队",
      "text": "雇佣兵呢！你们在干什么！还不反击？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者纠察队",
      "text": "*粗口*！*粗口*！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者纠察队",
      "text": "其他人呢！快撤！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "没有其他人了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者纠察队",
      "text": "*粗口*！我的腿！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "给我乖乖趴在地上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "当然，我也欢迎你挑战我的耐心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "阿尔苏先生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "亚、亚历山大先生！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "带着其他人躲起来，待在屋子里别出来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "text": "好，好的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者纠察队",
      "text": "你......你们这些败类......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "刚才的威风哪儿去了？现在可就剩下你一个人了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者纠察队",
      "text": "*粗口*，你敢对纠察队动手，不要命的混蛋！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者纠察队",
      "text": "你等着，洛蒙诺上校的部队就在附近！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者纠察队",
      "text": "费季索夫大人不会放过你的，你死定了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "贵族，乡绅，地主。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "我还能期待什么，你们乌萨斯军队就这点本事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佣兵",
      "text": "你......你不是乌萨斯人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "我确实不是乌萨斯人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "比起认识你们嘴里的地主老爷，我这里有一位朋友更想见见你们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "来认识一下捷格加廖夫同志。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "战车拍了拍架在地上的机枪，厚重的头盔下露出了不易察觉的笑容。\n大口径铳械的爆响声穿过了寒冬的山林，惊起一片羽兽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
